@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
### Create department
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Engineering","description":"Product development team"}

### Create role
POST {{baseUrl}}/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Developer","description":"Builds and maintains software"}

### List departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments

### List roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/roles

### Create employee (change departmentId/roleIds if your IDs differ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Asha","lastName":"Kumar","email":"asha.kumar@example.com","phone":"9876543210","joiningDate":"2025-05-01","departmentId":1,"roleIds":[1]}

### List employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
